  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added covariant IRaster and ISpatialRaster abstractions, generic spatial field rasterization, and Boolean point influence fields. Breaking changes include renaming IGrid to IRaster and SpatialRasterGrid to RasterGeometry, deriving SpatialRaster from Raster, removing redundant raster dimension properties and ToRaster, and renaming raster value mapping to MapValues. Tightened contour, raster geometry, resolution, value-count, and index validation. Expanded raster, field, ownership-contract, package-compatibility, and documentation coverage.",
